elevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/1/1a/Stage_Caves_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826072901\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Catacombs\" title=\"Catacombs\"><img alt=\"Stage Catacombs icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Catacombs icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Catacombs_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/2/23/Stage_Catacombs_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826072821\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flooded_Caves\" title=\"Flooded Caves\"><img alt=\"Stage Flooded Caves icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Flooded Caves icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Flooded_Caves_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/e/ef/Stage_Flooded_Caves_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073202\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Depths\" title=\"Depths\"><img alt=\"Stage Depths icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Depths icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Depths_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/7/7b/Stage_Depths_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073002\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Necropolis\" title=\"Necropolis\"><img alt=\"Stage Necropolis icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Necropolis icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Necropolis_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/2/2d/Stage_Necropolis_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073022\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dank_Depths\" title=\"Dank Depths\"><img alt=\"Stage Dank Depths icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Dank Depths icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Dank_Depths_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/0/04/Stage_Dank_Depths_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073222\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Womb\" title=\"Womb\"><img alt=\"Stage Womb icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Womb icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Womb_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/4/4c/Stage_Womb_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210826073122\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Challenge_Room\" title=\"Challenge Room\"><img alt=\"Challenge Room Icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Challenge Room Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Challenge_Room_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/1/1b/Challenge_Room_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821102142\" /></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><div id=\"context-page\" class=\"context-box\"><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-14\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Afterbirth\"><img alt=\"(except in Rebirth)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc a indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_a_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/9/95/Dlc_a_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20220122155526\" /></span></span> </div>\n<p><b>Dukie</b> is an enemy added in <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Binding_of_Isaac:_Afterbirth\" title=\"The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth\">The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth</a></i>. It floats diagonally around the room, occasionally spitting out 1-2 &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fly#Dart_Fly\" title=\"Fly\"><img alt=\"Dart Fly\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dart Fly.png\" data-image-key=\"Dart_Fly.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/b/b8/Dart_Fly.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821165011\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Fly#Dart_Fly\" title=\"Fly\">Dart Flies</a>. Dukies do not attack in any other way but can still do contact damage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>If there are 6 &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fly#Dart_Fly\" title=\"Fly\"><img alt=\"Dart Fly\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dart Fly.png\" data-image-key=\"Dart_Fly.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/b/b8/Dart_Fly.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821165011\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Fly#Dart_Fly\" title=\"Fly\">Dart Flies</a> spawned, Dukies will stop spawning Dart Flies.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/2/2c/Dukie_Sad.png/revision/latest?cb=20210824165905\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Unused sad Dukie sprite\"><img alt=\"Unused sad Dukie sprite\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dukie Sad.png\" data-image-key=\"Dukie_Sad.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/2/2c/Dukie_Sad.png/revision/latest?cb=20210824165905\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Unused sad Dukie sprite</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Dukies were inspired by a <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=tpPcp17z9Pg\">video by LeatherIceCream about a miniature Duke Of Flies</a>.</li>\n<li>&#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Duke_of_Flies\" title=\"The Duke of Flies\"><img alt=\"Boss The Duke of Flies ingame